{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3c07f870ddf7e92b","name":"Flamethrower","source":{"id":"source:reference-3c07f870ddf7e92b","title":"Flamethrower","revision":18221,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:48:27Z","sha256":"81d570270bff9f68aaf3d47931f80f15d9d11862f2b720a012eda4022b5f90a1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18221","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Flamethrower&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3c07f870ddf7e92b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Flamethrower is a ranged weapon that shoots a cone of burning chemicals in a 6-Square ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cone"},". Make a single attack roll and compare it to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of every target within this area (this is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},"). A successful attack deals 3d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"}," damage to the target; if the attack misses, the target takes half damage instead. A target with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Evasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Evasion"}]}," Talent takes half damage from a successful attack, and no damage if the attack misses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Reloading the Flamethrower is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". The weapon can be used five times before its chemical supply is depleted. Replacement chemical cartridges for the Flamethrower cost 200 credits, and weigh 4 kg each.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Ranged)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)","referenceId":"reference:c954289d43de9110"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 3d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 7 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire","referenceId":"reference:c141faa80e43a119"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"}," weapon.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
